WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:01.560
Enough

00:01.640 --> 00:03.040
This matter ends here

00:03.440 --> 00:04.880
Those involved in the seditious poem

00:04.960 --> 00:06.160
Have all been executed

00:06.280 --> 00:07.680
None left

00:08.920 --> 00:10.320
As for Yu Gong

00:14.840 --> 00:17.760
The Imperial City Guard watches you closely

00:18.680 --> 00:20.120
As soon as Chu Huan mobilized men

00:20.200 --> 00:21.960
They immediately submitted a report

00:22.520 --> 00:23.040
To

00:23.160 --> 00:24.560
My desk

00:31.280 --> 00:32.600
You

00:32.680 --> 00:33.960
Act decisively

00:34.040 --> 00:35.160
Strike ruthlessly

00:35.320 --> 00:36.720
Eloquent

00:36.800 --> 00:37.840
Ungrateful

00:37.920 --> 00:39.320
Father

00:40.080 --> 00:41.480
In this world

00:41.840 --> 00:43.840
You're not the only clever one

00:44.000 --> 00:45.360
I say, second son

00:45.840 --> 00:47.720
One mistake is acceptable

00:48.040 --> 00:49.707
But not a second time

00:50.600 --> 00:51.760
That Yu Gong

00:51.840 --> 00:53.507
Let it rest for now

00:56.320 --> 00:58.560
You haven't been to the palace in a while

00:58.640 --> 00:59.520
Accompany me

00:59.600 --> 01:01.267
For a game of chess

01:01.720 --> 01:03.120
Yes, Father
